    "question": {
      ":question/id": "8049705b-92b8-5a91-88e2-fce5e45c22d9",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the **exact** value.\n\n$$\n2\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)-1\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the cosine double-angle identity:\n\n$$\n2\\cos^2\\left(x\\right)-1=\\cos(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the angle and evaluate the standard-angle cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&2\\cos^2\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right)-1 \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(2\\cdot \\frac{\\pi}{12}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right) \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
